From 880b3e4c03a731c94fae0018bdf6395a8d386451 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Twilight0 <twilight0@vivaldi.net>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:17:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] nouveau,nvk,nak: initial Fermi (NVC3/SM20) bring-up

- Lower nvk_physical_device.c gate from KEPLER_A to FERMI_A
- Pass fb/tt_ctxdma_handle = 0 in nouveau_ws_3d_context_init for chipset < 0xe0
- Emit explicit SET_OBJECT on copy (NV90B5) and 2D (NV902D) subchannels on Fermi
- Guard M2MF SET_OBJECT behind NVKMD_ENGINE_M2MF and Kepler+ sampler/align asserts
- Use NV9097_INVALIDATE_SHADER_CACHES instead of NVA097_INVALIDATE_SHADER_CACHES_NO_WFI on Fermi
- Enable sm >= 20 in nak_nir_lower_tex.c

Verified vulkaninfo enumeration and headless 0x9097 triangle draw + readback
(Pixel(32,32) = (64, 191, 128, 255)) on GeForce GT 555M (NVC3).

Generated-by: LLM
